 "us_only_note": "Mandate is a US company. These carry non-US domains. .co was NOT treated as foreign (Colombian TLD, but widely used as a US vanity domain - s1inc.co and rayselectric.co read as US firms). ppultd.co.uk is the material one: it is filed as a campaign-P2, i.e. an active outreach target, and has already been enriched. It should be DQd. The remaining five are already master-DQ priority and sit in the queue tail, so the 1200-cap will not reach them.",
 "ownership_note": "Alt-domain email flags are a proxy for an undisclosed parent/acquirer (CLAUDE.md rule 6: platform ownership labels are unverified). Most resolve to sister or rebrand domains and are benign. cates.com is the one to check: two separate contacts there carry i2r.com addresses, which reads as a holding-company parent rather than a rebrand."
